==Requirements==
Player must complete [[Quest:Your First Weapon]] in order to do [[Quest:Fighting off the Pack]]
==To Start==
Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
==Goals==
Learn how to use your weapon by fighting Hooligan Wolves.
*Switch to the Brawler job
*Knock out Hooligan Wolves - /5
*Return to Cleetus Farnum
==Steps==
#Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
#*"Unfortunately now is one of those times to where you’ll need to use that hammer. Use it to defeat 5 Hooligan Wolves. Be sure to switch to your Brawler job. Return to me when you are finished." -Cleetus Farnum
#Switch to the [[Brawler]] [[Job]].
#Knock out Hooligan Wolves - /5
#*Knock out 5 [[Hooligan Wolves]] nearby in the [[Wilds]].
#Speak with [[Cleetus Farnum]] that can be found on [[Farnum's Farm]] located in Southern [[Wilds]].
#*"We should be having less wolf attacks after the trashing that you gave those Hooligan Wolves." -Cleetus Farnum
